WEBVTT

1
00:00:17,708 --> 00:00:18,958
{\an8}BULAN PALING BERDARAH

2
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:24,416
{\an8}<i>Pemerintah Meksiko mengerahkan</i>
<i>pasukan AD dan AL ke seantero negeri</i>

3
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,625
{\an8}<i>untuk menekan tingginya</i>
<i>gelombang kejahatan.</i>

4
00:00:27,708 --> 00:00:29,916
{\an8}<i>Ini hanyalah sebagian dari kejahatan</i>

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,750
{\an8}<i>yang dituduhkan</i>
<i>pada Iván Gastélum, alias El Cholo.</i>

6
00:00:32,833 --> 00:00:36,791
{\an8}<i>…memukul telak kartel lewat penangkapan</i>
<i>salah satu anggotanya, El Chapo.</i>

7
00:00:36,875 --> 00:00:39,833
{\an8}<i>Pagi ini diadakan upacara penghormatan</i>

8
00:00:39,916 --> 00:00:43,500
{\an8}<i>bagi para anggota polisi</i>
<i>yang gugur dalam tugas.</i>

9
00:00:43,583 --> 00:00:45,708
{\an8}<i>Keberhasilan penangkapan ini…</i>

10
00:00:45,791 --> 00:00:49,125
{\an8}<i>Telah terjadi lagi bentrokan sengit</i>

11
00:00:49,208 --> 00:00:52,375
{\an8}<i>antara Polisi Federal dan Kartel Sinaloa.</i>

12
00:01:15,791 --> 00:01:18,208
{\an8}Taruh tangan di meja!
Hei, jangan bertindak bodoh!

13
00:01:18,291 --> 00:01:19,625
{\an8}<i>Bertindak bodoh…</i>

14
00:01:33,875 --> 00:01:37,000
FACING EL CHAPO

15
00:01:37,083 --> 00:01:39,833
BERDASARKAN KISAH NYATA

16
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:49,083
{\an8}6 JANUARI 2016, PUKUL 07.00
LOS MOCHIS, SINALOA

17
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:57,291
Hentikan!

18
00:01:59,625 --> 00:02:00,625
Elízabeth!

19
00:02:01,208 --> 00:02:05,000
Elízabeth, Ayah takkan bilang dua kali.
Hentikan itu, paham?

20
00:02:05,583 --> 00:02:08,500
- Seragamnya sudah siap. Ini kopimu.
- Makasih. Bagus.

21
00:02:08,583 --> 00:02:12,666
Hei, belikan mainan yang lebih pantas.
Boneka Barney, Barbie.

22
00:02:12,750 --> 00:02:14,666
Aku tak pernah beli barang begituan!

23
00:02:14,750 --> 00:02:16,458
Ini dari Carlitos, Ayah.

24
00:02:16,541 --> 00:02:18,708
Carlitos, si kesayangan kita…

25
00:02:18,791 --> 00:02:20,875
Hei! Berhenti dan duduklah!

26
00:02:20,958 --> 00:02:22,458
- Diam.
- Elízabeth.

27
00:02:22,541 --> 00:02:25,666
- Makanlah. Ini enak.
- Kapan Ayah akan belikan komputer?

28
00:02:26,250 --> 00:02:29,125
Komputer bisa bikin kami anteng
seperti kata Ibu.

29
00:02:29,208 --> 00:02:30,208
Astaga.

30
00:02:32,750 --> 00:02:34,250
Kau atau aku yang bilang?

31
00:02:35,208 --> 00:02:36,958
Kau memang pintar, Joana.

32
00:02:37,041 --> 00:02:38,041
Sudah Ibu bilang.

33
00:02:38,125 --> 00:02:40,708
Begitu ada uangnya,
Ayah akan membelikannya.

34
00:02:40,791 --> 00:02:44,166
Tapi Ayah mau tanya dulu.
Pantaskah kalian dapat komputer,

35
00:02:44,250 --> 00:02:47,083
padahal kau terus mengganggu kakakmu
dan kau baru kerjakan PR?

36
00:02:47,166 --> 00:02:48,208
- Tidak.
- Ya!

37
00:02:48,291 --> 00:02:50,458
- "Ya" apanya?
- Baiklah, tidak.

38
00:02:52,583 --> 00:02:55,458
Tapi semua nilaiku bagus, Ayah!

39
00:02:55,541 --> 00:02:56,916
- Berusaha lebih keras.
- Pagi!

40
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,458
Kita bahas itu nanti.

41
00:02:58,541 --> 00:03:00,458
Masuklah. Mau kopi atau lainnya?

42
00:03:00,541 --> 00:03:02,291
Tak perlu. Ini sudah telat!

43
00:03:02,375 --> 00:03:04,291
- Ayo pergi!
- Baiklah, ayo berangkat.

44
00:03:04,375 --> 00:03:07,416
Kalian main-main terus,
jadi tak sempat sarapan. Astaga!

45
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:09,083
- Dah, Arturo.
- Jangan nakal.

46
00:03:09,166 --> 00:03:11,750
- Ayo, cepatlah!
- Aduh, maaf, Sayang.

47
00:03:11,833 --> 00:03:13,708
- Hati-hati di jalan.
- Cepatlah!

48
00:03:13,791 --> 00:03:15,166
- Kami berangkat.
- Oke.

49
00:03:15,250 --> 00:03:16,833
Terima kasih, Say! Dadah!

50
00:03:23,166 --> 00:03:25,291
Liz anak yang sangat bersemangat.

51
00:03:25,375 --> 00:03:27,708
Kita harus waspada, dia lumayan bandel.

52
00:03:27,791 --> 00:03:29,000
Benar.

53
00:03:29,083 --> 00:03:31,208
Duduklah, ayo sarapan.

54
00:03:31,791 --> 00:03:33,000
Aku tidak lapar.

55
00:03:36,208 --> 00:03:37,708
Ada apa?

56
00:03:38,500 --> 00:03:41,125
Aku tak enak badan belakangan ini.

57
00:03:46,208 --> 00:03:48,375
Ada apa?

58
00:03:48,458 --> 00:03:51,291
Apa kau sakit?
Kau pusing, sakit perut, atau apa?

59
00:03:54,041 --> 00:03:55,208
Aku hamil.

60
00:04:04,250 --> 00:04:06,166
Aku hamil, Arturo.

61
00:04:11,958 --> 00:04:13,083
Apa kau bercanda?

62
00:04:13,166 --> 00:04:15,291
Untuk apa aku bercanda soal ini?

63
00:04:18,500 --> 00:04:20,083
Anak perempuan lagi

64
00:04:20,583 --> 00:04:21,750
atau anak lelaki?

65
00:04:21,833 --> 00:04:23,416
Astaga!

66
00:04:26,166 --> 00:04:27,958
Tapi kau minum pil KB, bukan?

67
00:04:33,333 --> 00:04:37,166
Ya, aku sudah hati-hati, tapi sempat
kelupaan minum beberapa hari.

68
00:04:37,250 --> 00:04:38,291
Aku ceroboh.

69
00:04:46,250 --> 00:04:48,458
Aku sudah menghitungnya,

70
00:04:48,541 --> 00:04:50,541
gajiku bisa penuhi kebutuhan kita.

71
00:04:53,333 --> 00:04:58,375
Kita harus bayar cicilan rumah,
mobil, dan kebutuhan anak-anak.

72
00:04:58,458 --> 00:05:00,375
Kita sudah kewalahan, Sayang.

73
00:05:01,375 --> 00:05:02,375
Yah…

74
00:05:03,666 --> 00:05:05,583
Jika memberatkan, gugurkan saja.

75
00:05:06,250 --> 00:05:07,916
Tidak, bukan begitu.

76
00:05:08,416 --> 00:05:10,666
Ini soal kita harus sepaham.
Jika akan punya bayi,

77
00:05:10,750 --> 00:05:13,041
aku harus minta sif malam
agar dapat uang lebih.

78
00:05:13,125 --> 00:05:14,666
Tidak, jangan sif malam.

79
00:05:15,375 --> 00:05:18,333
- Terlalu berbahaya.
- Lantas, aku harus bagaimana?

80
00:05:18,416 --> 00:05:21,250
Ya, ini pasti akan sulit,
aku harus terbiasa,

81
00:05:21,333 --> 00:05:23,791
tapi aku takkan terbiasa tidak makan.

82
00:05:26,375 --> 00:05:29,208
Lebih baik aku miskin
daripada menjadi janda.

83
00:05:32,208 --> 00:05:33,458
Oh, Sayang…

84
00:05:38,583 --> 00:05:40,500
Boleh bicara sebentar, Pak?

85
00:05:40,583 --> 00:05:42,250
Masuklah, Carmona.

86
00:05:43,791 --> 00:05:44,750
Ada apa?

87
00:05:46,458 --> 00:05:49,750
Aku ingin tahu
apakah aku boleh pindah ke sif malam.

88
00:05:49,833 --> 00:05:53,208
Tidak boleh. Kau dibutuhkan di sif siang.

89
00:05:55,333 --> 00:05:57,500
Begini, masalahnya…

90
00:05:57,583 --> 00:06:00,708
Tunjangan sif malam lebih banyak,
gajinya lebih besar…

91
00:06:04,750 --> 00:06:06,125
istriku hamil lagi,

92
00:06:06,208 --> 00:06:08,875
dan dengan semua pengeluaran
yang harus kutanggung…

93
00:06:09,375 --> 00:06:10,750
Punya anak lagi?

94
00:06:11,666 --> 00:06:12,666
Ya.

95
00:06:18,083 --> 00:06:19,583
<i>Apa kabar, Say?</i>

96
00:06:19,666 --> 00:06:22,583
Aku habis mengambil baju bayinya
dari rumah Vicky.

97
00:06:24,208 --> 00:06:25,333
Semuanya baik?

98
00:06:25,416 --> 00:06:27,625
Ya, semuanya baik-baik saja.

99
00:06:27,708 --> 00:06:30,750
Bajunya bisa kusimpan
sampai kau memberitahunya.

100
00:06:33,125 --> 00:06:34,458
Dia sudah kuberi tahu.

101
00:06:36,083 --> 00:06:37,375
Lalu, dia bilang apa?

102
00:06:38,458 --> 00:06:40,500
Ujung-ujungnya dia cuma menenangkan aku.

103
00:06:40,583 --> 00:06:42,791
Dia mau ambil sif malam,

104
00:06:43,500 --> 00:06:45,500
padahal jalanan sangat berbahaya.

105
00:06:47,333 --> 00:06:49,333
POLISI FEDERAL

106
00:06:53,166 --> 00:06:54,166
Carmona.

107
00:06:55,291 --> 00:06:56,833
Ya, Pak.

108
00:06:56,916 --> 00:06:59,833
Ada petugas
yang baru dimutasi dari Arteaga.

109
00:07:00,416 --> 00:07:02,625
- Dari Nuevo León?
- Michoacán.

110
00:07:02,708 --> 00:07:06,000
- Situasi di sana lumayan genting, 'kan?
- Kau sudah tahu.

111
00:07:06,500 --> 00:07:07,875
Nama belakangnya Rosales.

112
00:07:08,458 --> 00:07:09,958
Dia akan bertugas malam

113
00:07:10,041 --> 00:07:13,041
dan aku bingung
harus memasukkannya ke regu patroli mana.

114
00:07:13,708 --> 00:07:16,416
- Kebetulan sekali, ya?
- Ya.

115
00:07:16,500 --> 00:07:18,708
Bayi itu jimat keberuntunganmu.

116
00:07:18,791 --> 00:07:20,916
Yah, semoga begitu.

117
00:07:22,125 --> 00:07:23,541
Awasi Rosales.

118
00:07:24,083 --> 00:07:25,416
Pantau dengan saksama.

119
00:07:25,500 --> 00:07:27,375
Kita tak tahu apa yang dia sembunyikan.

120
00:07:27,458 --> 00:07:29,791
- Ya, aku akan tetap waspada.
- Baiklah.

121
00:07:29,875 --> 00:07:32,875
Kembali bekerja.
Kau bertugas dua sif hari ini.

122
00:07:32,958 --> 00:07:34,875
- Terima kasih.
- Ya.

123
00:07:35,458 --> 00:07:38,500
Setengah telanjang atau telanjang bulat?

124
00:07:38,583 --> 00:07:40,166
Telanjang bulat.

125
00:07:41,333 --> 00:07:43,500
- Telanjang bulat?
- Ya.

126
00:07:44,583 --> 00:07:46,916
- Silakan. Sampai jumpa.
- Terima kasih.

127
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,875
- Sandra.
- Andrea.

128
00:07:48,958 --> 00:07:50,250
Andrea!

129
00:07:58,708 --> 00:08:00,958
Sudah dulu, ya? Dah.

130
00:08:01,041 --> 00:08:03,166
Sif ini cuma bisa dilalui
dengan banyak kopi.

131
00:08:06,916 --> 00:08:09,958
Jadi, kopinya harus enak dan pekat.

132
00:08:11,166 --> 00:08:13,041
Bukankah kau dari Michoacán?

133
00:08:13,125 --> 00:08:16,291
Santai, Bung. Aku sedang melatih aksenku.

134
00:08:24,791 --> 00:08:26,708
Menurutmu kopi ini pekat?

135
00:08:29,041 --> 00:08:30,958
Kita baru memulai sifnya.

136
00:08:33,833 --> 00:08:35,625
Yah, selamat datang di Mochis.

137
00:08:37,666 --> 00:08:38,916
Ayo!

138
00:08:39,416 --> 00:08:41,625
{\an8}POLISI FEDERAL

139
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:07,375
- Kau lihat itu?
- Jika berulah, mereka akan menghajarnya.

140
00:09:07,458 --> 00:09:10,166
Tidak, kurasa dia bisa mengatasinya.

141
00:09:13,208 --> 00:09:14,208
Tidak, tunggu…

142
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,541
Sialan!

143
00:09:35,625 --> 00:09:38,041
- Selamat malam.
- Selamat malam.

144
00:09:39,125 --> 00:09:41,250
- Semuanya sudah beres?
- Sudah, Pak.

145
00:09:46,416 --> 00:09:49,000
- Bangunkan. Bawa mereka pergi!
- Bawa mereka!

146
00:09:49,083 --> 00:09:51,208
Selamat malam, Pak. Butuh bantuan?

147
00:09:51,791 --> 00:09:54,708
Tidak perlu. Semuanya sudah terkendali.

148
00:09:55,291 --> 00:09:56,375
Permisi.

149
00:09:56,458 --> 00:09:57,458
Cepat.

150
00:10:02,166 --> 00:10:03,166
Ayo.

151
00:10:06,750 --> 00:10:07,791
Ayo bangun.

152
00:10:10,333 --> 00:10:12,708
Jangan pura-pura, Bajingan.

153
00:10:12,791 --> 00:10:17,125
- Kami dari Tijuan. Tak tahu areanya.
- Ternyata kau memang tak tahu, ya.

154
00:10:18,708 --> 00:10:20,291
Dasar keparat.

155
00:10:34,250 --> 00:10:37,125
Pasti kalian sudah mendata
barang yang disita.

156
00:10:39,250 --> 00:10:40,333
Tenang saja, Pak.

157
00:10:43,250 --> 00:10:44,125
Hei, jangan!

158
00:10:44,208 --> 00:10:45,666
"Jangan" apa?

159
00:10:46,958 --> 00:10:48,125
Jaga nada bicaramu.

160
00:10:50,416 --> 00:10:51,375
Sabunya banyak.

161
00:10:53,541 --> 00:10:57,375
Kami akan dengan senang hati
mengawal kalian ke kantor jaksa.

162
00:10:59,791 --> 00:11:02,875
Akan segera kulaporkan penyitaan ini
pada atasanku.

163
00:11:14,250 --> 00:11:15,458
Baik, Pak.

164
00:11:17,750 --> 00:11:18,916
Ayo pergi ke Ahome.

165
00:11:19,833 --> 00:11:20,833
Ayo!

166
00:11:24,291 --> 00:11:25,291
Hei!

167
00:11:31,916 --> 00:11:33,125
Selamat malam.

168
00:11:34,333 --> 00:11:35,333
Semuanya baik?

169
00:11:46,666 --> 00:11:47,500
Ya.

170
00:11:48,791 --> 00:11:49,916
Majulah.

171
00:12:14,291 --> 00:12:15,583
Kami akan mengikuti kalian.

172
00:12:17,791 --> 00:12:20,500
Ayo pergi dari sini! Cepat!

173
00:12:32,375 --> 00:12:33,750
Markas, markas.

174
00:12:34,250 --> 00:12:35,500
Carmona…

175
00:12:36,291 --> 00:12:38,750
Kau menggagalkan kesepakatan petugas itu.

176
00:12:44,708 --> 00:12:47,125
Terima kasih, Erick.

177
00:12:55,125 --> 00:12:56,750
<i>Malam ini, bagaimana?</i>

178
00:12:56,833 --> 00:12:58,958
<i>Sampai jumpa di Motel pelabuhan.</i>

179
00:12:59,041 --> 00:13:01,458
<i>Dan jangan lepas seragammu.</i>

180
00:13:04,833 --> 00:13:05,833
Ini kopimu.

181
00:13:11,708 --> 00:13:13,375
Ini yang menurutmu enak?

182
00:13:14,375 --> 00:13:16,000
Ini kopi terbaik di Mochis.

183
00:13:20,250 --> 00:13:21,541
Rosales…

184
00:13:23,041 --> 00:13:24,958
Ada apa dengan penjahat itu?

185
00:13:29,291 --> 00:13:30,416
Apa maksudmu?

186
00:13:31,375 --> 00:13:33,625
Kau memperlihatkan apa di ponselmu?

187
00:13:35,041 --> 00:13:37,375
Metodemu sedikit aneh.

188
00:13:37,458 --> 00:13:38,791
Tunggu, apa?

189
00:13:40,458 --> 00:13:43,000
Kau ingin aku menjelaskan caraku bekerja?

190
00:13:47,541 --> 00:13:48,708
Apa masalahmu?

191
00:13:51,166 --> 00:13:52,708
Tidak ada.

192
00:14:03,958 --> 00:14:05,250
Bajingan sialan.

193
00:14:15,791 --> 00:14:16,958
Arturo?

194
00:14:17,708 --> 00:14:19,083
Selamat pagi, Sayang.

195
00:14:19,166 --> 00:14:20,916
- Selamat pagi.
- Hai, Sayang.

196
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:23,041
Bagaimana keadaanmu? Mau sarapan?

197
00:14:23,125 --> 00:14:25,666
Aku lebih mengantuk daripada lapar,
tapi mau makan dulu.

198
00:14:25,750 --> 00:14:29,625
Ada <i>machaca </i>sapi.
Pastilah kau capek, kau bekerja dua sif.

199
00:14:31,500 --> 00:14:33,541
Imut sekali! Buatan siapa ini?

200
00:14:33,625 --> 00:14:35,666
Joana. Dia seniman, tahu.

201
00:14:35,750 --> 00:14:37,958
- Gambarnya bagus.
- Minumlah jus ini.

202
00:14:38,041 --> 00:14:39,250
Baiklah.

203
00:14:40,958 --> 00:14:42,375
Ceritakan padaku.

204
00:14:43,125 --> 00:14:46,208
Bagaimana partner barumu?
Apa kau suka dia?

205
00:14:49,541 --> 00:14:51,875
Aku masih belum tahu bagaimana orangnya.

206
00:14:52,458 --> 00:14:53,875
Kenapa? Ada apa?

207
00:14:56,291 --> 00:14:58,291
Entahlah.
Mungkin karena baru hari pertama.

208
00:15:00,625 --> 00:15:01,666
Bagaimana keadaanmu?

209
00:15:06,083 --> 00:15:07,083
Baik.

210
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:16,458
Yah, aku sudah merenungkan
yang kau katakan padaku

211
00:15:16,541 --> 00:15:18,541
- dan mungkin…
- Dengar…

212
00:15:19,791 --> 00:15:20,916
Maafkan aku.

213
00:15:21,833 --> 00:15:24,125
Jujur, kau membuatku terkejut dan…

214
00:15:26,500 --> 00:15:29,541
Tapi punya anak lagi bukanlah masalah.
Kita pasti baik-baik saja.

215
00:15:31,333 --> 00:15:32,500
Kau yakin?

216
00:15:36,916 --> 00:15:38,333
Yakin sepenuhnya.

217
00:16:15,916 --> 00:16:18,375
Sayang, kau baik-baik saja?

218
00:16:20,333 --> 00:16:21,583
Jam berapa ini?

219
00:16:22,083 --> 00:16:24,166
Sebentar lagi jam 19.30.

220
00:16:24,250 --> 00:16:27,291
Rekanmu, Rosales, sudah menunggu di luar.

221
00:16:30,708 --> 00:16:31,916
Rosales?

222
00:16:45,458 --> 00:16:46,833
Anak-anak.

223
00:16:49,291 --> 00:16:51,750
- Kalian sudah mengerjakan PR?
- Sudah.

224
00:16:52,500 --> 00:16:55,500
Bagus. Pergilah ke kamar
dan kenakan piama kalian.

225
00:16:55,583 --> 00:16:58,250
- Ayo cepat.
- Selamat malam dan senang berkenalan.

226
00:16:58,333 --> 00:17:00,375
- Sama-sama.
- Sampai nanti.

227
00:17:00,458 --> 00:17:02,416
Gosok gigi dulu. Ini sudah larut.

228
00:17:03,708 --> 00:17:04,833
Kenapa kau ke sini?

229
00:17:06,291 --> 00:17:07,708
Aku bawa kopi untuk berbaikan.

230
00:17:16,916 --> 00:17:18,750
Baiklah. Aku keluar sebentar lagi.

231
00:17:20,333 --> 00:17:22,291
Kau punya keluarga yang harmonis.

232
00:17:37,583 --> 00:17:39,666
Saat Valladares menugaskan aku bersamamu,

233
00:17:40,458 --> 00:17:42,083
namamu terdengar tak asing.

234
00:17:43,375 --> 00:17:45,958
Tapi aku tak ingat dari mana mendengarnya.

235
00:17:47,958 --> 00:17:49,625
Lalu, aku sadar.

236
00:17:50,125 --> 00:17:51,500
Gila!

237
00:17:51,583 --> 00:17:53,500
Petugas Carmona.

238
00:17:57,083 --> 00:17:58,791
Kasusmu menghebohkan.

239
00:18:01,583 --> 00:18:03,291
Kau lolos begitu saja, 'kan?

240
00:18:04,291 --> 00:18:06,916
Tahu apa yang membuatku jengkel
setiap malam?

241
00:18:10,083 --> 00:18:11,708
Para bocah yang mati itu.

242
00:18:14,375 --> 00:18:17,000
Aku berubah sejak saat itu.

243
00:18:17,083 --> 00:18:20,666
Aku tak bisa tidur nyenyak,
responsku kacau balau…

244
00:18:21,875 --> 00:18:22,958
Aku tamat.

245
00:18:23,500 --> 00:18:25,791
Bajingan itu yang membunuh mereka.

246
00:18:26,375 --> 00:18:28,375
Suatu keajaiban dia tak membunuhmu.

247
00:18:29,166 --> 00:18:30,166
Ya.

248
00:18:33,416 --> 00:18:36,083
Jujurlah, kenapa kau memakai jam mahal?

249
00:18:39,458 --> 00:18:42,416
- Kau tahu banyak soal jam?
- Cuma yang biasa saja.

250
00:18:42,500 --> 00:18:44,541
Karena selera kopimu payah.

251
00:18:58,500 --> 00:18:59,500
Pak.

252
00:19:09,625 --> 00:19:10,875
Kau dengar, Bravo?

253
00:19:11,375 --> 00:19:12,875
<i>Diterima, Alfa.</i>

254
00:19:12,958 --> 00:19:15,333
Harap konfirmasi
jumlah warga sipil di lokasi itu.

255
00:19:16,166 --> 00:19:19,625
<i>Tiga warga sipil terekam sejak kemarin.</i>
<i>Tidak ada yang keluar atau masuk.</i>

256
00:19:19,708 --> 00:19:22,083
<i>Kuulangi, hanya tiga warga sipil</i>
<i>yang terekam.</i>

257
00:19:25,333 --> 00:19:29,500
Sial! Taconya kebanyakan
untuk dua orang, bukan?

258
00:19:29,583 --> 00:19:33,000
Ya. Itu banyak sekali, Pak.

259
00:19:46,625 --> 00:19:48,708
Sialan.

260
00:19:53,833 --> 00:19:55,166
Mereka bersenjata.

261
00:19:55,666 --> 00:19:58,125
Mereka yang akan memakan semua taco itu.

262
00:20:02,625 --> 00:20:05,041
- Apa ada El Cholo?
- Entahlah.

263
00:20:10,666 --> 00:20:13,791
Dengar, jika Iván
alias El Cholo ada di sana,

264
00:20:14,833 --> 00:20:16,458
situasinya takkan mudah.

265
00:20:20,416 --> 00:20:22,041
Tapi kita takkan mati hari ini.

266
00:20:24,708 --> 00:20:25,833
{\an8}MARINIR

267
00:20:43,541 --> 00:20:44,875
<i>10-11, maju.</i>

268
00:21:06,833 --> 00:21:10,166
- Ayo cepat!
- Lari!

269
00:21:10,250 --> 00:21:13,791
Ayo maju, lindungi dia! Ayo!

270
00:21:13,875 --> 00:21:15,458
Ayo, Marinir!

271
00:21:15,958 --> 00:21:17,708
Maju. Dobrak pintunya!

272
00:21:17,791 --> 00:21:19,166
Sekarang. Masuk.

273
00:21:26,541 --> 00:21:28,750
Ayo! Masuk ke dalam, Marinir!

274
00:21:29,375 --> 00:21:31,166
Tolong, Foco! Tolong dia.

275
00:21:31,250 --> 00:21:33,875
- Kau akan baik-baik saja! Lindungi dia.
- Dua lagi!

276
00:21:37,083 --> 00:21:38,958
- Berbalik. Perlahan.
- Kau tak apa-apa.

277
00:21:39,041 --> 00:21:41,083
- Granat!
- Granat!

278
00:21:41,166 --> 00:21:42,250
Granat!

279
00:21:45,083 --> 00:21:49,041
Ayo masuk, Marinir!
Kita masuk, Semuanya! Ayo!

280
00:21:54,750 --> 00:22:00,250
Maju, Marinir! Terus maju!
Lindungi area itu! Berbaris!

281
00:22:02,125 --> 00:22:03,375
Hati-hati.

282
00:22:03,458 --> 00:22:06,250
Maju, Foco! Amankan tangga!

283
00:22:08,291 --> 00:22:10,833
- Maju, Marinir!
- Aku butuh satu lagi!

284
00:22:10,916 --> 00:22:13,000
- Ayo!
- Masuk, Marinir! Ayo maju!

285
00:22:16,250 --> 00:22:17,541
Masuk, Marinir!

286
00:22:19,666 --> 00:22:20,833
Ayo, Semuanya!

287
00:22:20,916 --> 00:22:23,625
Maju, Marinir! Periksa kamar itu.

288
00:22:23,708 --> 00:22:25,500
Jangan bergerak! Tiarap!

289
00:22:25,583 --> 00:22:28,083
- Kita masuk, Semuanya!
- Angkat tangan!

290
00:22:28,166 --> 00:22:29,541
Tiarap, Bajingan!

291
00:22:29,625 --> 00:22:31,791
Tunjukkan wajahmu! Ayo!

292
00:22:31,875 --> 00:22:33,541
- Tiarap!
- Jangan bergerak!

293
00:22:33,625 --> 00:22:35,375
Amankan pintu! Tiarap!

294
00:22:35,458 --> 00:22:36,583
Tiarap!

295
00:22:36,666 --> 00:22:38,041
- Amankan kamarnya!
- Komandan!

296
00:22:38,125 --> 00:22:39,416
Foco, masuklah!

297
00:22:39,500 --> 00:22:40,833
Angkat tangan!

298
00:22:40,916 --> 00:22:42,041
Tiarap, Bajingan!

299
00:22:42,125 --> 00:22:44,750
Periksa dengan saksama!

300
00:22:44,833 --> 00:22:50,958
Kau mau ke mana? Turun!
Turun, Bajingan! Ke tembok!

301
00:22:51,958 --> 00:22:53,416
Dia kabur ke mana?

302
00:22:53,500 --> 00:22:54,708
- Siapa?
- Iván, El Cholo!

303
00:22:54,791 --> 00:22:56,250
- Tak tahu.
- Jangan pura-pura!

304
00:22:56,333 --> 00:22:58,583
- Ke mana dia?
- Aku tak tahu. Aku bersamanya.

305
00:22:59,916 --> 00:23:01,333
- Marinir!
- Ya, Pak!

306
00:23:01,416 --> 00:23:03,416
Masuk! Amankan tangganya!

307
00:23:03,500 --> 00:23:04,500
Ya, Pak!

308
00:23:05,000 --> 00:23:06,458
Hei, jangan bergerak!

309
00:23:06,541 --> 00:23:07,750
Perlihatkan wajahmu!

310
00:23:08,250 --> 00:23:10,208
- Periksa dengan saksama!
- Jangan bergerak!

311
00:23:10,291 --> 00:23:13,166
Periksa semua perabot dan lemari!
Balikkan kasurnya!

312
00:23:13,916 --> 00:23:15,250
Tidak pakai masker!

313
00:23:15,333 --> 00:23:17,833
Iván, El Cholo, pasti ada di sini!

314
00:23:31,500 --> 00:23:33,958
Astaga! Bau tahi, Sialan, Cholo!

315
00:23:34,458 --> 00:23:35,791
Tahan dulu, Bos!

316
00:23:36,791 --> 00:23:38,541
Kita pernah lewati yang lebih buruk.

317
00:23:40,958 --> 00:23:42,458
Laksamana Madya, silakan.

318
00:23:44,833 --> 00:23:46,375
Apa yang kalian temukan?

319
00:23:46,458 --> 00:23:48,833
Kami menemukan perangkat ini.

320
00:23:49,375 --> 00:23:50,500
<i>Kau sudah di dalam?</i>

321
00:23:50,583 --> 00:23:51,958
Diam, Marinir!

322
00:23:55,375 --> 00:24:00,166
Aku muak kabur seperti tikus
lewat terowongan sialan begini!

323
00:24:08,875 --> 00:24:10,541
Itu dia! Potong, Marinir!

324
00:24:13,541 --> 00:24:14,541
Ayo masuk!

325
00:24:14,625 --> 00:24:16,041
Ada terowongan, Pak!

326
00:24:16,875 --> 00:24:19,458
Periksa terowongannya!
Lihat sejauh apa itu.

327
00:24:22,041 --> 00:24:23,041
Mustahil.

328
00:24:23,666 --> 00:24:26,541
Dasar bajingan!
Ada terowongan segala! Ayo!

329
00:24:44,583 --> 00:24:45,916
Sialan!

330
00:24:46,000 --> 00:24:47,291
- Kopral!
<i>- Siap, Pak!</i>

331
00:24:47,375 --> 00:24:50,541
Beri tahu Laksamana
kita butuh bantuan udara tambahan.

332
00:24:50,625 --> 00:24:52,166
<i>- Ya, Pak.</i>
- Segera!

333
00:24:52,250 --> 00:24:53,250
<i>Baik, Pak.</i>

334
00:24:54,750 --> 00:24:55,958
Bagaimana?

335
00:24:56,041 --> 00:24:59,875
Regu sudah kembali karena ketinggian air
mencegah mereka maju.

336
00:25:00,750 --> 00:25:03,708
- Terowongan itu menuju ke riol kota.
- Sialan!

337
00:25:04,875 --> 00:25:08,041
Jika El Cholo tak tenggelam,
berarti dia keluar dari lubang got.

338
00:25:09,916 --> 00:25:11,750
- Foco.
- Komandan.

339
00:25:11,833 --> 00:25:14,000
Suruh semuanya bersiap. Kita pergi.

340
00:25:14,083 --> 00:25:16,791
- Siapkan regu untuk awasi tempat ini.
- Baik.

341
00:25:16,875 --> 00:25:20,166
Letnan, minta unit udara melaporkan
aktivitas mencurigakan apa pun.

342
00:25:20,250 --> 00:25:21,958
- Kita berangkat!
- Baik, Pak!

343
00:25:22,041 --> 00:25:23,541
Ayo, Semuanya!

344
00:25:39,750 --> 00:25:42,125
Menurutmu itu tentara atau marinir?

345
00:25:42,625 --> 00:25:44,000
Entahlah.

346
00:25:45,500 --> 00:25:48,541
Aku cuma ingin segera pulang
karena mau bercinta.

347
00:25:50,208 --> 00:25:51,875
Sarapan, barangkali.

348
00:25:58,958 --> 00:26:00,458
- Selamat pagi.
- Hei!

349
00:26:00,541 --> 00:26:02,000
Lihat helikopternya?

350
00:26:02,083 --> 00:26:05,000
Kami dengar itu lewat tadi.
Mereka mau ke mana?

351
00:26:05,500 --> 00:26:09,875
Marinir terlibat dalam bentrokan,
tapi mereka belum mengabari dengan siapa.

352
00:26:10,500 --> 00:26:13,791
Mereka meminta semua unit kita
untuk tidak bergerak.

353
00:26:14,833 --> 00:26:17,625
- Baik.
- Tetaplah di sini dan jaga jembatan.

354
00:26:18,125 --> 00:26:19,541
Kami akan terus berjaga.

355
00:26:25,458 --> 00:26:26,458
Dah!

356
00:26:27,833 --> 00:26:29,958
Marinir itu memicu kehebohan.

357
00:26:33,833 --> 00:26:35,833
Sepertinya kau batal bercinta.

358
00:26:35,916 --> 00:26:37,250
Diam, Carmona!

359
00:26:37,333 --> 00:26:40,500
Jika jadi kau,
aku akan minta maaf pada gadis itu.

360
00:26:42,583 --> 00:26:44,250
Atau pria itu, entahlah.

361
00:26:45,625 --> 00:26:47,416
Enak saja kau, Bajingan.

362
00:26:49,291 --> 00:26:51,291
Aku bisa bantu kau bercinta kapan pun.

363
00:26:51,375 --> 00:26:52,750
Sialan!

364
00:26:59,208 --> 00:27:01,666
<i>Di Reynosa, Tamaulipas</i>

365
00:27:01,750 --> 00:27:04,375
<i>Para pria sangat gigih</i>

366
00:27:04,458 --> 00:27:07,166
<i>Oleh karena itu, kami mengenang mereka</i>

367
00:27:07,250 --> 00:27:09,958
<i>Dengan menyanyikan lagu mereka</i>

368
00:27:10,041 --> 00:27:13,916
<i>Di Zacatecas, mereka membunuh</i>

369
00:27:14,000 --> 00:27:19,958
<i>petugas patroli tol</i>

370
00:27:21,375 --> 00:27:24,958
Basi banget selera musikmu, Carmona!

371
00:27:25,833 --> 00:27:27,791
"El Federal de Caminos"? Yang benar saja!

372
00:27:27,875 --> 00:27:31,291
- Memangnya kau dengar musik apa?
- Musik sungguhan, dong!

373
00:27:31,791 --> 00:27:33,750
Misalnya, Los Ángeles Negros.

374
00:27:34,250 --> 00:27:36,958
Jika kita keluar dari sini,
kau boleh menikahi istriku.

375
00:27:38,333 --> 00:27:39,833
Istri yang mana, Bos?

376
00:27:39,916 --> 00:27:41,541
Jangan membuatku tertawa!

377
00:27:46,000 --> 00:27:47,583
- Carmona.
- Apa?

378
00:27:49,083 --> 00:27:50,458
Seberbahaya apakah di sana?

379
00:27:52,416 --> 00:27:55,125
Yah, terkadang berbahaya,

380
00:27:55,208 --> 00:27:57,750
terkadang normal, saat ini lumayan tenang.

381
00:27:58,583 --> 00:27:59,583
Lalu…

382
00:28:00,583 --> 00:28:02,000
apa mereka memberi suap?

383
00:28:05,791 --> 00:28:06,791
Bukan kepadaku.

384
00:28:39,958 --> 00:28:40,791
Keluar!

385
00:28:40,875 --> 00:28:42,916
Keluar! Keluar dari mobil!

386
00:28:43,000 --> 00:28:44,791
- Baik, kami keluar.
- Diam!

387
00:28:44,875 --> 00:28:47,708
Ayo keluar! Kami sedang buru-buru!

388
00:28:49,458 --> 00:28:50,541
Ayo!

389
00:28:53,083 --> 00:28:54,458
- Ibu!
- Tak apa-apa.

390
00:28:55,500 --> 00:28:56,625
Kau baik-baik saja?

391
00:28:57,791 --> 00:28:59,833
- Tidak apa-apa, Sayang.
- Halo?

392
00:29:14,250 --> 00:29:15,208
Ambulans!

393
00:29:15,291 --> 00:29:19,000
<i>Dikonfirmasi.</i>
<i>Tidak ada penembak jitu di sini. 87-7.</i>

394
00:29:19,083 --> 00:29:20,166
Kau baik-baik saja?

395
00:29:22,708 --> 00:29:26,791
<i>Siaga: 5621 dilaporkan</i>
<i>di Jalan Guillermo Prieto.</i>

396
00:29:26,875 --> 00:29:32,000
<i>Sebuah Ford Focus merah tahun 2005,</i>
<i>pelat nomor kendaraan VKW206.</i>

397
00:29:32,083 --> 00:29:35,916
<i>Kuulangi, pelat nomor kendaraan VKW206.</i>

398
00:29:37,083 --> 00:29:40,125
Sialan, kita sudah bekerja
selama 12 jam nonstop!

399
00:29:42,583 --> 00:29:43,750
Jangan mengeluh.

400
00:29:45,000 --> 00:29:46,708
Kita akan dapat uang lembur.

401
00:29:46,791 --> 00:29:49,541
Aku tak mau lembur. Aku mau bercinta.

402
00:30:03,666 --> 00:30:04,541
Lihat.

403
00:30:04,625 --> 00:30:07,833
- Itu mobil yang dicuri?
- Sepertinya begitu.

404
00:30:13,666 --> 00:30:15,166
Dengar aku, 18?

405
00:30:19,166 --> 00:30:22,208
Ada 55 dengan 56, kemungkinan 21.

406
00:30:25,208 --> 00:30:28,166
<i>Segera hentikan kendaraan Anda</i>
<i>dan menepi ke kanan.</i>

407
00:30:36,291 --> 00:30:37,208
Keluar!

408
00:30:38,166 --> 00:30:40,750
Tenang, Cholo. Mereka akan menolong kita.

409
00:30:45,250 --> 00:30:48,916
Ada apa, Polisi Sialan?
Di mana komandan kalian?

410
00:30:49,583 --> 00:30:52,291
- Aku sedang mengantar Bos!
- Taruh pistolnya!

411
00:30:54,458 --> 00:30:58,000
Mungkin kalian mujur hari ini.
Sudahi saja, kami harus segera pergi.

412
00:30:58,083 --> 00:31:00,375
- Diam!
- Taruh pistolnya!

413
00:31:06,000 --> 00:31:06,916
Mundur dua langkah!

414
00:31:08,125 --> 00:31:09,625
Mundur dua langkah!

415
00:31:22,708 --> 00:31:24,500
Tangan di luar!

416
00:31:26,250 --> 00:31:27,375
Pakailah.

417
00:31:28,916 --> 00:31:30,458
Sudah, Bajingan.

418
00:31:31,166 --> 00:31:32,208
Pergilah ke sana.

419
00:31:36,333 --> 00:31:38,916
Hei… Hei, hei!

420
00:31:49,250 --> 00:31:50,416
Kau tahu siapa aku?

421
00:32:06,625 --> 00:32:07,791
Ya, aku tahu.

422
00:32:12,583 --> 00:32:14,500
Harap keluar dari kendaraan.

423
00:32:27,750 --> 00:32:30,250
Tenang, Bung. Ayo bereskan ini.

424
00:32:30,750 --> 00:32:33,833
- Kalian harus antar kami ke Che Ríos.
- Diamlah.

425
00:32:42,208 --> 00:32:43,208
Berbalik.

426
00:32:44,875 --> 00:32:47,083
Jalanlah ke mobil patroli.

427
00:32:48,833 --> 00:32:50,000
Jalan.

428
00:32:50,583 --> 00:32:51,625
Masuklah.

429
00:32:52,125 --> 00:32:54,250
Masuk, Bajingan! Ayo.

430
00:32:59,083 --> 00:33:00,083
Hei.

431
00:33:07,291 --> 00:33:08,333
Masuk.

432
00:33:09,333 --> 00:33:10,541
Masuk!

433
00:33:16,958 --> 00:33:18,083
Carmona.

434
00:33:34,291 --> 00:33:35,416
Jangan memotret!

435
00:33:35,500 --> 00:33:37,583
- Diam!
- Polisi anjing!

436
00:33:38,541 --> 00:33:40,833
- Prosedurnya, kau harus diborgol.
- Persetan.

437
00:33:58,375 --> 00:33:59,750
Sialan!

438
00:34:11,833 --> 00:34:12,916
Sialan!

439
00:34:14,625 --> 00:34:16,375
Mau apa kau, Bajingan?

440
00:34:17,291 --> 00:34:18,708
Mau kau apakan fotonya?

441
00:34:19,666 --> 00:34:22,875
Bertindak bodoh, maka tamatlah kita.

442
00:34:24,291 --> 00:34:27,041
- Kau di pihak siapa?
- Di pihak diriku sendiri!

443
00:34:27,875 --> 00:34:30,250
- Sial.
- Biarkan aku berpikir!

444
00:34:31,833 --> 00:34:34,083
Terakhir kali kau mengikuti prosedur,

445
00:34:35,666 --> 00:34:37,083
orang tak bersalah tewas.

446
00:34:37,666 --> 00:34:39,083
Jangan mengungkitnya!

447
00:34:39,958 --> 00:34:42,833
Foto ini bisa menyelamatkan kita berdua.

448
00:34:42,916 --> 00:34:45,166
Dia El Chapo Guzmán, Bajingan!

449
00:34:47,750 --> 00:34:51,875
Kita harus melepaskan mereka
dan pergi dari sini.

450
00:34:54,208 --> 00:34:55,208
Carmona…

451
00:34:59,458 --> 00:35:01,083
Aku tak mau mati hari ini.

452
00:35:06,541 --> 00:35:07,875
Pasti kau pun begitu.

453
00:35:09,916 --> 00:35:11,291
Ayolah, Bung.

454
00:35:15,750 --> 00:35:17,750
Mereka sudah melihat kita,

455
00:35:18,666 --> 00:35:20,333
dan tahu mobil patroli kita.

456
00:35:23,041 --> 00:35:25,416
Jika mereka kabur, kita tamat.

457
00:35:27,250 --> 00:35:28,916
Jika kita mengantar mereka…

458
00:35:29,500 --> 00:35:31,416
