Namun, jika kau tak dipenjara…

928
01:17:07,125 --> 01:17:08,875
kau takkan keluar hidup-hidup.

929
01:17:50,291 --> 01:17:52,000
Cepat maju!

930
01:17:52,875 --> 01:17:54,208
Apa itu Ayah?

931
01:17:54,291 --> 01:17:55,875
- Siapa itu?
- Siapa di luar?

932
01:17:55,958 --> 01:17:58,458
Siapa di luar? Kenapa Ibu ketakutan?

933
01:17:58,541 --> 01:18:02,166
- Ayah akan segera datang.
- Siapa di luar?

934
01:18:02,250 --> 01:18:05,416
- Pelankan suaramu. Semua akan membaik.
- Ada apa Ibu?

935
01:18:05,500 --> 01:18:07,666
- Ibu, ada apa?
- Sut. Tenanglah.

936
01:18:07,750 --> 01:18:11,833
DUA MOBIL PEMBUNUH BAYARAN DATANG KE RUMAH
KAMI BERTIGA ADA DI RUMAH.

937
01:18:14,875 --> 01:18:17,541
PEMBUNUH BAYARAN DATANG KE RUMAH
KAMI BERTIGA ADA DI RUMAH.

938
01:18:26,041 --> 01:18:27,000
Sialan.

939
01:18:35,500 --> 01:18:37,166
- Arturo!
- Isa.

940
01:18:37,250 --> 01:18:39,625
Arturo, ada dua mobil di luar rumah…

941
01:18:41,583 --> 01:18:42,541
Hei!

942
01:18:42,625 --> 01:18:43,958
Kumohon, jangan!

943
01:18:44,041 --> 01:18:46,208
Keluar dari rumahku, Bajingan!

944
01:18:46,291 --> 01:18:48,500
- Kumohon, jangan!
- Siapa itu?

945
01:18:48,583 --> 01:18:50,166
Keluar!

946
01:18:50,250 --> 01:18:52,666
Anak buahku sudah sampai di rumahmu.

947
01:18:54,500 --> 01:18:55,875
<i>Kumohon!</i>

948
01:18:57,875 --> 01:19:00,958
Suruh dia lepaskan mereka!

949
01:19:02,000 --> 01:19:04,333
Suruh dia lepaskan mereka, Keparat!

950
01:19:11,500 --> 01:19:13,458
Menurutmu bagaimana ini akhirnya?

951
01:19:14,791 --> 01:19:17,583
Sudah kubilang.
Ini akibat tingkah sok jagoanmu.

952
01:19:19,291 --> 01:19:22,125
Kedua putriku masih kecil.

953
01:19:22,208 --> 01:19:23,541
<i>Kumohon!</i>

954
01:19:23,625 --> 01:19:26,916
Mereka akan ditembaki habis-habisan.
Kau tak bisa apa-apa.

955
01:19:27,000 --> 01:19:27,833
<i>Kumohon…</i>

956
01:19:34,958 --> 01:19:35,958
<i>- Kumohon!</i>
- Isa.

957
01:19:37,583 --> 01:19:38,416
Keluar!

958
01:19:39,000 --> 01:19:40,250
Kumohon.

959
01:19:40,875 --> 01:19:42,041
Jangan sakiti…

960
01:19:42,125 --> 01:19:43,333
Keluar!

961
01:19:44,208 --> 01:19:46,958
Jangan sakiti mereka!
Mereka cuma anak-anak!

962
01:19:47,041 --> 01:19:48,041
Ke…

963
01:20:01,166 --> 01:20:04,541
Tamatlah kau, Berengsek!

964
01:20:04,625 --> 01:20:06,083
Jatuhkan senjatamu!

965
01:20:07,541 --> 01:20:08,958
Celakalah kau, Anjing!

966
01:20:09,041 --> 01:20:10,166
Jangan bertindak bodoh!

967
01:20:10,250 --> 01:20:12,000
Kau tamat, Keparat!

968
01:20:14,250 --> 01:20:15,916
Aku Laksamana Madya Ortega!

969
01:20:16,000 --> 01:20:18,083
Tamatlah kau, Bajingan!

970
01:20:18,166 --> 01:20:19,416
Letakkan senjatamu!

971
01:20:42,000 --> 01:20:44,583
<i>Arturo… Kami baik-baik saja.</i>

972
01:21:01,625 --> 01:21:02,875
Ada apa, Bu?

973
01:21:04,625 --> 01:21:06,833
Tentara datang, dan kami tak apa-apa.

974
01:21:20,833 --> 01:21:23,583
Liburan enam bulanmu sudah selesai, Chapo.

975
01:21:24,083 --> 01:21:25,083
Ya.

976
01:21:26,625 --> 01:21:27,916
Sudah selesai.

977
01:21:34,166 --> 01:21:36,541
- Bajingan kau!
- Tenanglah.

978
01:21:36,625 --> 01:21:38,000
Tenanglah.

979
01:21:39,458 --> 01:21:40,625
Bawa dia pergi.

980
01:21:40,708 --> 01:21:43,041
Sialan. Jangan sentuh aku.

981
01:21:45,625 --> 01:21:47,125
Marinir!

982
01:21:50,333 --> 01:21:53,166
Kini kau dalam pengawasan
Angkatan Laut Meksiko.

983
01:21:55,166 --> 01:21:57,208
Ada penjahat lainnya di mobil.

984
01:21:58,041 --> 01:21:59,333
Cek apakah masih hidup.

985
01:22:01,000 --> 01:22:02,250
Baik, Pak.

986
01:22:03,500 --> 01:22:04,750
Bawa bajingan itu!

987
01:22:12,625 --> 01:22:15,291
Tentara Meksiko! Menyerahlah!

988
01:22:15,375 --> 01:22:17,625
Ayo cepat semuanya tiarap!

989
01:22:17,708 --> 01:22:18,958
Tangan di belakang kepala!

990
01:22:19,041 --> 01:22:20,583
Serahkan senjata kalian!

991
01:22:20,666 --> 01:22:21,958
Ayo bergegas! Teruskan!

992
01:22:33,708 --> 01:22:35,333
Kami menyerahkan Iván, El Cholo.

993
01:22:36,416 --> 01:22:37,750
Keparat.

994
01:22:42,750 --> 01:22:44,875
- Kau baik-baik saja?
- Ya, Pak.

995
01:22:47,166 --> 01:22:48,166
Kerja bagus.

996
01:22:49,041 --> 01:22:52,875
Jangan khawatir,
keluarga dan rumahmu dilindungi tentara.

997
01:22:53,916 --> 01:22:56,125
- Terima kasih.
- Selamat siang.

998
01:22:57,125 --> 01:22:58,750
Aku Laksamana Madya Ortega.

999
01:22:59,666 --> 01:23:02,166
Petugas, terima kasih kerja samanya.

1000
01:23:02,875 --> 01:23:04,083
Pak Komisaris,

1001
01:23:04,916 --> 01:23:08,083
silakan pergi secepat mungkin
demi keselamatan kalian.

1002
01:23:08,916 --> 01:23:12,083
Dari sini, Marinir akan menangani
warga yang ditahan ini.

1003
01:23:20,625 --> 01:23:21,541
Sedang apa kau?

1004
01:23:33,166 --> 01:23:37,583
Anggota Polisi Federal-lah
yang menangkap Guzmán Loera,

1005
01:23:37,666 --> 01:23:39,750
jadi kita akan
ke hanggar kepresidenan bersama

1006
01:23:39,833 --> 01:23:41,916
untuk membuat laporan, mengerti?

1007
01:23:50,916 --> 01:23:53,458
- Marinir!
- Ya, Pak!

1008
01:23:54,458 --> 01:23:57,000
- Turunkan senjata kalian!
- Ya, Pak!

1009
01:23:57,708 --> 01:24:00,166
Polisi Federal, turunkan senjata kalian!

1010
01:24:02,625 --> 01:24:04,666
- Marinir!
- Ya, Pak!

1011
01:24:04,750 --> 01:24:06,541
- Mari kawal mereka.
- Ya, Pak!

1012
01:24:10,625 --> 01:24:12,125
Bagus, Bung.

1013
01:24:26,166 --> 01:24:29,750
{\an8}8 JANUARI 2016, PUKUL 10.32
LOS MOCHIS, SINALOA

1014
01:24:50,083 --> 01:24:52,791
- Semua baik-baik saja?
- Ya, baik.

1015
01:24:54,125 --> 01:24:56,833
Para bajingan itu
ingin merebut semua pujian.

1016
01:24:57,416 --> 01:25:00,041
Aku tak peduli siapa yang mendapatkannya.

1017
01:25:02,625 --> 01:25:05,125
Masalahnya, mereka bisa saja
membiarkan kita mati.

1018
01:25:05,208 --> 01:25:08,083
Tidak, Carmona. Jangan bilang begitu.

1019
01:25:08,166 --> 01:25:09,708
Aku pensiun setahun lagi.

1020
01:25:12,375 --> 01:25:13,375
Sialan.

1021
01:25:15,250 --> 01:25:16,416
Kenapa kau di sini?

1022
01:25:17,250 --> 01:25:20,333
Pertanyaanku sama. Kenapa kau ada di sini?

1023
01:25:20,833 --> 01:25:23,166
Kalian membuat keributan besar.

1024
01:25:23,958 --> 01:25:25,500
Kalian menangkap El Chapo!

1025
01:25:26,291 --> 01:25:27,208
Keren banget!

1026
01:25:27,791 --> 01:25:31,625
Kawanku ini, Barraza,
berani ambil risiko dan berhasil bertahan.

1027
01:25:33,125 --> 01:25:35,583
- Terima kasih.
- Sama-sama.

1028
01:25:35,666 --> 01:25:37,708
Aku ada urusan. Sampai jumpa lagi.

1029
01:25:40,083 --> 01:25:41,750
Semoga lancar!

1030
01:25:47,458 --> 01:25:48,458
Gila!

1031
01:25:50,791 --> 01:25:52,458
- Terima kasih, Partner.
- Sama-sama.

1032
01:25:52,541 --> 01:25:53,541
Terima kasih.

1033
01:25:56,125 --> 01:25:58,666
- Kita berdua bodoh, 'kan?
- Bodoh sekali.

1034
